.Dd September 4, 2026
.Dt WORKERD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm workerd
.Nd "runs the Worker application server"
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl Fl no-daemon
.Op Fl Fl control Ar socket
.Op Fl Fl group Ar name
.Op Fl Fl user Ar name
.Op Fl Fl log Ar file
.Op Fl Fl modules Ar directory
.Op Fl Fl pid Ar file
.Op Fl Fl state Ar directory
.Nm
.Op Fl h | Fl Fl help | v | Fl Fl version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Worker is a dynamically configured application server for UNIX-like systems.
It runs application code in multiple language runtimes and manages application
processes through a JSON control API.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl Fl help
Displays a summary of Worker's command-line options and their compile-time
defaults.
.It Fl v , Fl Fl version
Displays Worker's version and the
.Pa ./configure
settings it was built with.
.It Fl Fl no-daemon
Runs Worker in non-daemon mode.
.It Fl Fl control Ar socket
Overrides the control API's socket address in IPv4, IPv6, or UNIX-domain
format.
.It Fl Fl group Ar name , Fl Fl user Ar name
Override the group and user used to run Worker's non-privileged processes.
.It Fl Fl log Ar file
Overrides the pathname for Worker's log.
.It Fl Fl modules Ar directory
Overrides the directory path for Worker language module
.Po Pa *.worker.so
.Pc files.
.It Fl Fl pid Ar file
Overrides the pathname for the PID file of Worker's main process.
.It Fl Fl state Ar directory
Overrides the directory path for Worker's state storage.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Exit status is 0 on success, or 1 if the daemon encounters an error.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa %%PID_PATH%%
The PID file of Worker's main process.
.It Pa %%ERROR_LOG_PATH%%
A general-purpose log for diagnostics and troubleshooting.
.El
.Sh SOCKETS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa %%SOCKET_PATH%%
The socket address of Worker's control API.
.El
.Sh AUTHORS
(C) 2026, Zhidao HONG
.Pp
Worker is derived from NGINX Unit.  Original copyright notices are retained in
the NOTICE file.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Pp
GitHub:
.Pa https://github.com/hongzhidao/worker
